  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Afternoon Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    08 August 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good afternoon Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,173.00/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AITEO</td>\n                <td>₦1,168.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>A.A RANO</td>\n                <td>₦1,170.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BULK STRATEGIC</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SIGMUND</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,169.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,169.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO LAGOS</td>\n                <td>₦1,168.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MAINLAND</td>\n                <td>₦1,180.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,557.38/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,550.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,550.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBACHEM</td>\n                <td>₦1,550.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBETO</td>\n                <td>₦1,550.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SAHARA</td>\n                <td>₦1,554.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,555.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,555.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>SAHARA ONNE</td>\n                <td>₦1,595.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Again, Major Marketers Cut Diesel Prices Further Despite Higher Landing Cost\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Nigeria’s diesel market is showing a widening disconnect between benchmark replacement costs and actual depot selling prices. Some independent marketers and importers are now offering Automotive Gas Oil (AGO) below Dangote Refinery's latest price. According to MEMAN the landing cost of imported diesel stands at about ₦1,575/litre.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/again-major-marketers-cut-diesel-prices-further-despite-higher-landing-cost\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Ukraine Hits Two Russian Refineries in Deep Drone Strikes\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky identified the targets as the Bashneft-Novoil refinery in Bashkortostan. The Yaroslavl refinery was reported to have caught fire following the attack. Images and videos circulated online showed substantial smoke rising from the refinery.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/ukraine-hits-two-russian-refineries-in-deep-drone-strikes\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Nigeria Spent N1.16tn on Fuel Subsidy in 2021 — RMAFC\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Nigeria’s fuel subsidy bill reached N1.16 trillion in 2021, according to the Revenue Mobilisation Allocation and Fiscal Commission (RMAFC) The figures were presented by RMAFC Chairman, Dr Mohammed Bello Shehu, before the Senate Public Accounts Committee (SPAC) The committee is examining audit reports on the sector.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/nigeria-spent-n116tn-on-fuel-subsidy-in-2021-rmafc\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Depot Owners Purchase Over 439 Million Litres of Diesel From Dangote in July\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Domestic depot owners and downstream marketers purchased about 360,000 metric tonnes (MT), equivalent to 439 million litres, from the Dangote Petroleum Refinery in July 2026. Masters Energy recorded the largest identified volume, according to a loading operations schedule obtained by Petroleumprice.ng.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/depot-owners-purchase-over-439-million-litres-of-diesel-from-dangote-in-july\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Beats U.S. Again to Become Europe’s Biggest Jet Fuel Supplier\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Dangote Petroleum Refinery has overtaken the United States as Europe’s largest supplier of imported jet fuel for the second consecutive month. The refinery said more than 400,000 tonnes of jet fuel produced at its Lekki facility were delivered to Europe in July.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-beats-us-again-to-become-europes-biggest-jet-fuel-supplier\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
